---
description: Industrial decision and synthetic evidence guardrails
globs: "src/**/*.py,data/**/*.json,config/**/*.yaml"
alwaysApply: true
---

- `real_decision` uses public evidence only.
- Synthetic records require `synthetic_flag=true`, `scenario_id`, `source=DEMO_GENERATOR`, Class D and a visible warning label.
- Never ADVANCE the real case past unresolved hard gates.
- Unknown capability states do not improve D*.
- Keep thresholds in versioned YAML, not code.
- Unit-value dispersion never proves a grade.
- Brownfield and no-action precede supported greenfield.
- Preserve the two public golden outcomes exactly unless the governing methodology and frozen snapshot are formally changed.
